\w* \w in the Nile|strong="H2975"\w* \w will die|strong="H4191"\w*, \w the river|strong="H2975"\w* \w will stink|strong="H887"\w*, \w and the Egyptians|strong="H4713"\w* \w will be unable|strong="H3811"\w* \w to drink|strong="H8354"\w* \w its|strong="H2975"\w* \w water|strong="H4325"\w*.’”
