\p \v 20 \w Moses|strong="H4872"\w* \w and Aaron|strong="H175"\w* \w did|strong="H6213"\w* \w just as|strong="H834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w had commanded|strong="H6680"\w*; \w in the presence|strong="H5869"\w* \w of Pharaoh|strong="H6547"\w* \w and his officials|strong="H5650"\w*, \w Aaron raised|strong="H7311"\w* \w the staff|strong="H4294"\w*\f + \fr 7:20 \ft Hebrew \fqa he raised the staff\ft ; see verse 19; some translators \fqa Moses raised the staff\ft .\f* \w and struck|strong="H5221"\w* \w the water|strong="H4325"\w* \w of the Nile|strong="H2975"\w*, \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the water|strong="H4325"\w* \w was turned|strong="H2015"\w* \w to blood|strong="H1818"\w*. \v 21 \w The fish|strong="H1710"\w* \w in the Nile|strong="H2975"\w* \w died|strong="H4191"\w*, \w and the river|strong="H2975"\w* \w smelled so bad|strong="H887"\w* \w that the Egyptians|strong="H4713"\w* \w could|strong="H3201"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* \w drink|strong="H8354"\w* \w its|strong="H2975"\w* \w water|strong="H4325"\w*. \w And there was|strong="H1961"\w* \w blood|strong="H1818"\w* \w throughout|strong="H3605"\w* \w the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H4714"\w*.
\p \v 22 \w But the magicians|strong="H2748"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H4714"\w* \w did|strong="H6213"\w* \w the same things|strong="H3651"\w* \w by their magic arts|strong="H3909"\w*. \w So Pharaoh’s|strong="H6547"\w* \w heart|strong="H3820"\w* \w was hardened|strong="H2388"\w*, \w and he would not|strong="H3808"\w* \w listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w to Moses and Aaron|strong="H413"\w*, \w just as|strong="H834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w had said|strong="H1696"\w*. \v 23 \w Instead, Pharaoh|strong="H6547"\w* \w turned around|strong="H6437"\w*, \w went|strong="H935"\w* \w into|strong="H413"\w* \w his palace|strong="H1004"\w*, \w and did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w take|strong="H7896"\w* \w any|strong="H1571"\w* \w of this|strong="H2063"\w* \w to heart|strong="H3820"\w*. \v 24 \w So all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the Egyptians|strong="H4713"\w* \w dug|strong="H2658"\w* \w around|strong="H5439"\w* \w the Nile|strong="H2975"\w* \w for water|strong="H4325"\w* \w to drink|strong="H8354"\w*, \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w they could|strong="H3201"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* \w drink|strong="H8354"\w* \w the water|strong="H4325"\w* \w from the river|strong="H2975"\w*.
