\c 21
\s1 Hebrew Servants
\r (\ref Deuteronomy 15:12–18|DEU 15:12-18\ref*)
\p \v 1 “\w These|strong="H428"\w* \w are the ordinances|strong="H4941"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w you are to set|strong="H7760"\w* \w before them|strong="H6440"\w*:
