\p \v 20 \w Behold|strong="H2009"\w*, \w I|strong="H595"\w* \w am sending|strong="H7971"\w* \w an angel|strong="H4397"\w* \w before you|strong="H6440"\w* \w to protect you|strong="H8104"\w* \w along the way|strong="H1870"\w* \w and to bring you|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the place|strong="H4725"\w* \w I have prepared|strong="H3559"\w*. \v 21 \w Pay attention|strong="H8104"\w* \w to him|strong="H6440"\w* \w and listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w to his voice|strong="H6963"\w*; \w do not|strong="H408"\w* \w defy|strong="H4843"\w* him, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w he will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w forgive|strong="H5375"\w* \w rebellion|strong="H6588"\w*, \w since|strong="H3588"\w* \w My Name|strong="H8034"\w* \w is in him|strong="H7130"\w*.
