\p \v 1 \w Then the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w said|strong="H1696"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Moses|strong="H4872"\w*, \v 2 “\w Tell|strong="H1696"\w* \w the Israelites|strong="H1121"\w* \w to bring|strong="H3947"\w* Me \w an offering|strong="H8641"\w*. \w You are to receive|strong="H3947"\w* \w My offering|strong="H8641"\w* \w from every|strong="H3605"\w* \w man|strong="H376"\w* \w whose|strong="H834"\w* \w heart|strong="H3820"\w* \w compels him|strong="H5068"\w*. \v 3 \w This|strong="H2063"\w* \w is the offering|strong="H8641"\w* \w you are to accept|strong="H3947"\w* \w from them|strong="H854"\w*:
