\p \v 10 \w And the LORD said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Behold|strong="H2009"\w*, \w I|strong="H595"\w* \w am making|strong="H3772"\w* \w a covenant|strong="H1285"\w*. \w Before|strong="H5048"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w your people|strong="H5971"\w* \w I will perform|strong="H6213"\w* \w wonders|strong="H6381"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w have never|strong="H3808"\w* \w been done|strong="H1254"\w* \w in any|strong="H3605"\w* \w nation|strong="H1471"\w* \w in all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the world|strong="H776"\w*. \w All|strong="H3605"\w* \w the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w among whom you live|strong="H7130"\w* \w will see|strong="H7200"\w* \w the LORD’s|strong="H3068"\w* \w work|strong="H4639"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w it is|strong="H1931"\w* \w an awesome thing|strong="H3372"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w am doing|strong="H6213"\w* \w with you|strong="H5973"\w*.
