\p \v 19 \w The first offspring|strong="H6363"\w* \w of every|strong="H3605"\w* \w womb|strong="H7358"\w* belongs to Me, \w including all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the firstborn|strong="H6363"\w* \w males|strong="H2142"\w* \w among your livestock|strong="H4735"\w*, \w whether cattle|strong="H7794"\w* \w or sheep|strong="H7716"\w*. \v 20 \w You must redeem|strong="H6299"\w* \w the firstborn|strong="H6363"\w* \w of a donkey|strong="H2543"\w* \w with a lamb|strong="H7716"\w*; \w but if|strong="H518"\w* \w you do not|strong="H3808"\w* \w redeem it|strong="H6299"\w*, \w you are to break its neck|strong="H6202"\w*. \w You must redeem|strong="H6299"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the firstborn|strong="H1060"\w* \w of your sons|strong="H1121"\w*. \w No|strong="H3808"\w* \w one shall appear|strong="H7200"\w* \w before Me|strong="H6440"\w* \w empty-handed|strong="H7387"\w*.
